AUDIO: 'Nvidia just released its brand new real-time AI animation tool Audi and it runs completely locally on as little as 6 GB [music] of VRAM. And I\'m going to show you today exactly how to set it up on your own PC, how to use it, and how'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you can later use it to retarget your 3D AI character in Blender. In addition to that, you will also learn how to edit your animations in real-time, how to add way points and constraints, and how you can even chain different animations'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'together for more control than ever before. [music] So, let\'s get into it. Hey guys and welcome back to the channel. As always, my name is Philip from Pixel Artistry. And today I\'m really excited to show you Nvidia Audi'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and this [music] is kind of a continuation from Nvidia Chimodu, which I showed in one of my previous videos. But Nvidia Audi has the real strength because it\'s actually real-time. So, we don\'t need to wait minutes for our'

