VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'generation. So, let me directly show you how you can use it. Here we are on their website. So, here we can definitely see what Nvidia Audi is about. You can also give through. So, basically you can use text to motion. And besides text to'

[01:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'motion, we also have constraints. For example, you can see some good examples here and we can even performing like waypoints. So, we can then control where the character should go or in real-time let him know where he should go. This is'

