[16:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'can\'t really calculate, you know, like the thickness of his chest and so on. But we can fix that quickly by going into the pose mode in Blender, and then you can shift the bone around. Just make sure to delete the keyframes in the'

[16:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
